        "search-for-fail :parameters (?object - character ?thing - thing ?place - room) :precondition (and (believes-at ?object ?object ?place) (believes-in ?object ?thing ?place) (not (and (at ?object ?place) (in ?thing ?place)))) :effect (when (and (not (in ?thing ?place)) (at ?object ?place)) (not (believes-in ?object ?thing ?place))))": "(:action search-for-fail :parameters (?object - character ?thing - thing ?place - room) :precondition (and (believes-at ?object ?object ?place) (believes-in ?object ?thing ?place) (not (and (at ?object ?place) (in ?thing ?place)))) :effect (when (and (not (in ?thing ?place)) (at ?object ?place)) (not (believes-in ?object ?thing ?place))))",
